Pass the Swiss theory exam and obtain your driving license with myTheorie - your personal theory instructor 24 hours a day! Our app was created in cooperation with driving schools and professional instructors. All questions are developed in a way that they cover all possible theory areas that could come up in the real theory test by asa. Our app will help you to really UNDERSTAND the driving theory and feel comfortable when you will finally get on the road. 

Why myTheorie?
•	Best value for money - all-in-one application, that contains the most important theory areas explained in simple manner, more than 400 questions to practice, detailed explanation of correct answers and simulation of real exam;
•	Contains 2024 / 2025 theory questions and always up to date. App is automatically updated as soon as new questions are added to real test;
•	Intelligent learning modes and recommendations depending on your level. App will tell you when you are ready to take a real test;
•	Free demo mode (limited access) to try all features before you buy. Lifelong access after purchase – no subscriptions or extra costs;
•	Includes categories B, A, A1 (car / motorcycle / scooter)
•	Works offline - no internet connection needed.

What you will find inside:
•	Modern design with white and dark modes and high-quality pictures of traffic situations;
•	All road signs with explanations;
•	Easy сards for theory topics that explain critical theory areas in a simple way without boring study of official legal texts;
•	Practice questions with intelligent algorithm or by topic; train wrongly answered questions individually; mark favorite questions and repeat them easily;
•	Simulated theory exam – exactly as at the road traffic office;
•	Learning statistics with personalized recommendations;
•	Full support of official exam languages - English, German, French and Italian;
•	5 auxiliary languages to help you understand the questions and solutions: Spanish, Portuguese, Turkish, Serbo-Croatian, Albanian.
•	24/7 car theory support

Use our app to prepare yourself optimally for the car and motorcycle theory test (category A, A1 and B) in Switzerland, so that you can easily receive your learner's license in 2024 and your permanent driver's license soon afterwards.

Important note: The ASA (Association of Road Traffic Offices) reserves the right not to disclose up to 33% of exam questions in advance. Therefore the effective way to learn is not by memorizing the questions, but understanding the underlying traffic rules.
